  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_9af71a15903f4a4084fe0a06c0995c38",
      "statement": "The createConnector server action in lib/actions/connectors.ts validates FormData with insertConnectorSchema, encrypts oauthClientSecret (when present) and JSON.stringify(env) (when present) through lib/crypto.ts's AES-256-CBC primitive, and inserts the new row with a hard-coded status of 'connected'.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://lib/actions/connectors.ts#L18-L100",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:00f064f6f52cb8cc2c27a4e741464ece3594793cff451dded4ca9109382255f9:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_3daad9f32b6245e7b6d6e3de117dd08f",
      "statement": "Connector secrets (oauthClientSecret and env) are decrypted at exactly two read sites: GET /api/connectors in app/api/connectors/route.ts for the management UI, and the task worker in app/api/tasks/route.ts before passing the array to executeAgentInSandbox. Any other read path receives ciphertext only.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://app/api/connectors/route.ts#L23-L29",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:83c16a1b76f28cd847f51605108992042f878201b1667617e32fbe28af18e8ea:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://app/api/tasks/route.ts#L231-L238",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e8ce5d9d30be9bc1a84d80454c9f88bc3ac44089a625332f5dd919601023b46c:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_7339e3da8e014386ac4508bd9a411690",
      "statement": "The task worker selects connectors with both eq(connectors.userId, session.user.id) and eq(connectors.status, 'connected'), decrypts env and oauthClientSecret, then writes mcpServerIds = mcpServers.map(s => s.id) to the tasks row before invoking executeAgentInSandbox; the decrypted secrets are never persisted.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://app/api/tasks/route.ts#L542-L568",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:cc83d38608461bee59308e0ac9a1828386b33adfa15706fcc1716293a219bae6:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_a760656167b24f9d9a0bbc50aeb0c6a6",
      "statement": "Any error in the task worker's connector block is caught, logged as 'Warning: Could not fetch MCP servers, continuing without them', and the dispatcher is invoked with an empty mcpServers array — the only failure mode that is silently absorbed by the runtime.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://app/api/tasks/route.ts#L575-L578",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:b5c46a0cdbb9aef157e17163725874361de414b446439e666d483102a6935f4e:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_49c43675a48a40d8847400bc27defc90",
      "statement": "The Claude wrapper's installClaudeCLI iterates over mcpServers and runs one `claude mcp add` per server: `claude mcp add \"<name>\" -- <command>` with --env KEY=VAL flags for local servers, or `claude mcp add --transport http \"<name>\" \"<baseUrl>\"` with --header flags for remote servers. Every command is prefixed with ANTHROPIC_API_KEY and ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL populated from process.env.AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY and the literal 'https://ai-gateway.vercel.sh'; without that prefix the --header values are rejected.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://lib/sandbox/agents/claude.ts#L99-L150",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:ec10a31c5bfbe2fddadf081e768d7d8d6327c2537e0adcd0a0d0a878b16899ac:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_74c0b4187f6b4df9a7b4b8a55101c3af",
      "statement": "The Copilot wrapper does not run per-server add commands. It assembles a JSON { mcpServers: { <name>: { type, command/args/env or url/headers } } } object in memory, writes it to ~/.copilot/mcp-config.json, and passes the path to the Copilot CLI via --additional-mcp-config @<path> flag. It does not require an ANTHROPIC_API_KEY prefix because Copilot CLI is authenticated by GH_TOKEN/GITHUB_TOKEN set by the dispatcher's temp-env-var pattern.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://lib/sandbox/agents/copilot.ts#L103-L164",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:3608e554025000314008d1aad81165380527dac650cf1f2aef85a7138cc3a56a:"
        },
        {
